{"id":"n66031-3-7","stage":0,"title":"맑다 · 清脆","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66031-3-7-1","ko":"제 목소리 어때요?","zh":"我的声音怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"목소리","meaning":"嗓音，声音","explanation":"목소리：嗓音，声音","readings":[{"term":"목소리","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69464","senseId":"1","lemma":"목소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"47febdd9f8a45735","term":"목소리","zh":"嗓音，声音","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3","entryId":"69464","definition":"从人喉咙里发出的声音。","pronunciation":["목쏘리"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/31e8daad735db869b57d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66031-3-7-2","ko":"넌 목소리가 정말 맑아서 아나운서를 해도 되겠다.","zh":"你的声音非常清亮，当播音员也完全没问题。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"목소리가","meaning":"嗓音，声音","explanation":"목소리：嗓音，声音；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"목소리","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69464","senseId":"1","lemma":"목소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맑아서","meaning":"清脆，清亮，明亮","explanation":"맑다：清脆，清亮，明亮；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"맑다","audio":"/audio/c8398a865a7478831698.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66031","senseId":"3","lemma":"맑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아나운서를","meaning":"广播员，播音员","explanation":"아나운서：广播员，播音员；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아나운서","audio":"/audio/9de89526fae7b1603dc3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65976","senseId":"1","lemma":"아나운서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해도","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되겠다.","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"47febdd9f8a45735","term":"목소리","zh":"嗓音，声音","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3","entryId":"69464","definition":"从人喉咙里发出的声音。","pronunciation":["목쏘리"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"c8398a865a747883","term":"맑다","zh":"清脆，清亮，明亮","audio":"/audio/c8398a865a7478831698.mp3","entryId":"66031","definiti